	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Prestantissime <persName ref="p495">Bulingere</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Quantum ad pericula, ad martiria nescio, si dominus eam mihi coronam reservet.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Redeundum est in <placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Inprimis tam ipse quam alii rogabitis sedulo <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>patrem cęlestem, ut det mihi spiritum confidentię et gloriam suam in nobis <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>et per nos in dies promoveat.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Deinde curabis quamprimum ad me mitti, qua<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>qs historias depingi malueris in illis vasis.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ego, quantum tib<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>i et reliquis Helvetiorum ministris debeam ob receptam ab omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>humanitatem, exprimere re ipsa mallem quam verbis agnoscere.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Me igitur <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>habebitis semper addictissimum, ita faxit deus aliqua sese mihi occasio e<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>offeret vobis alique in re gratificandi.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Scribam ad te sedulo, si quid <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>fuerit novum; ita tu vicissim ad me rescribas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>D. <persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName> nomine meo petiit a <persName ref="p540">Calvino</persName> aliquot exempla<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ria astronomiam, de Interim <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>et quedam alia, et fortasse, sicuti mihi dixit, <persName ref="p4851">Foscovero</persName> vestro biblio<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>polę reddentur, et cum primum redierit <persName ref="p8101">Lelius</persName>, curabis, ut per ipsum ad me <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>transmittantur nunciando, quantum pecuniam sim pro illis missurus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Vale in domino meque ames.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Literas tuas ad me vel <placeName ref="l93">Clavennam</placeName> ad <placeName ref="l18">Augustinum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>vel ad <placeName ref="l36">Bergomum</placeName> ad <persName ref="p8186">Franciscum Belinchettum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Quod si D. <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><persName ref="p8101">lelius</persName> nimis <placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> immorabitur, optarem, ut per te ad <placeName ref="l93">Clavennam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>vel <placeName ref="l36">Bergomum</placeName> usque ad <persName ref="p8186">Belinchettum</persName> transmittendos curarentur.</s>
				</p>
